README.md

# Tests/ stays in the build context: Package.swift declares the AppTests
# target, and SwiftPM fails resolution outright when its sources are absent
# ("target 'AppTests' has overlapping sources"). `swift build` does not
# compile test targets, so this costs the release build nothing and never
# reaches the run image.
